Game and framework assemblies, resolved at build time, never redistributed here
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RestoreMonarchy.RocketRedist      Rocket.API, Rocket.Core, Rocket.Unturned
RestoreMonarchy.UnturnedRedist    Assembly-CSharp, SDG.NetTransport, UnityEngine
Lib.Harmony                       MIT
Krafs.Publicizer                  MIT, build-time only

No Smartly Dressed Games or Unity binary is tracked in this repository. The
plugins compile against the NuGet packages above and load against the real
assemblies the game server already has.

refs/SDG.NetPak.Runtime/ is ours: a source-only stand-in that declares the two
type names ARENA's Harmony patches need to name, because no redistributable
package carries SDG.NetPak.Runtime. It is referenced at compile time and never
shipped beside a plugin.

